2"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $1.3bn over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834584/000183458426000042/0001834584-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001834584-26-000042"},{"text":"Net cash of $5.7bn against total assets of $17.4bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834584/000183458426000042/0001834584-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001834584-26-000042"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-0.8% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834584/000183458426000042/0001834584-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001834584-26-000042"}],"bear":[{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 29.3% to 27.0% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834584/000183458426000042/0001834584-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001834584-26-000042"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-2.8% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834584/000183458426000042/0001834584-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001834584-26-000042"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $396.0m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834584/000183458426000042/0001834584-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001834584-26-000042"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.2% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834584/000162828026042901/0001628280-26-042901-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.